WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:30.765
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:31.035 --> 00:34.209
Hey, take it easy. Take a break.

3
00:34.209 --> 00:36.919
Man, you're working hard.

4
00:37.509 --> 00:39.925
Corporal Sung Yoon Mo. Thank you.

5
01:06.229 --> 01:08.331
Time to wake up!

6
01:12.680 --> 01:18.509
Sergeant Kang Chan Seok, Sergeant Choi Byeong Nam, one day left!

7
01:18.509 --> 01:20.869
Man, I wish I had Se Gye's energy.

8
01:20.869 --> 01:24.269
Corporal Kim Dong Woo, I worked hard too.

9
01:24.269 --> 01:26.287
Man, I'm sore.

10
01:26.287 --> 01:28.169
Muscle pain right before discharge...

11
01:28.169 --> 01:32.389
Muscle pain right before discharge! I really can't get up.

12
01:32.389 --> 01:35.189
I'm so jealous of you two.

13
01:35.189 --> 01:38.891
Jealous? I don't have to wake up early anymore.

14
01:38.891 --> 01:42.169
No idea when my discharge date is.

15
01:42.169 --> 01:46.648
If you were discharged, wouldn't you both be sleeping right now?

16
01:46.648 --> 01:50.263
Of course. I'd be passed out at home.

17
01:50.263 --> 01:53.189
Sorry, you're stuck here because of me.

18
01:53.189 --> 01:55.365
Thanks for staying with me, though!

19
01:55.365 --> 01:59.769
Why so sudden? I stayed of my own free will!

20
01:59.769 --> 02:04.866
If Chan Seok hadn't gone to the brig, he'd be a civilian by now.

21
02:04.866 --> 02:07.509
Shut it.

22
02:07.509 --> 02:11.309
But I like having you both here longer.

23
02:11.309 --> 02:15.409
Exactly. I wish you could stay longer.

24
02:15.409 --> 02:18.249
Really? Should I consider it for Se Gye?

25
02:18.249 --> 02:20.389
Applying for professional sergeant?

26
02:20.389 --> 02:24.006
Are you crazy? No more of this, you punk.

27
02:25.062 --> 02:27.830
The day is finally coming. It's tomorrow, right?

28
02:27.830 --> 02:29.024
Tomorrow.

29
02:29.024 --> 02:31.900
- Chan Seok! - Choi Byeong Nam!

30
02:31.900 --> 02:33.153
I can't.

31
02:33.153 --> 02:35.523
- Wi-Fi, Wi-Fi... - Wi-Fi.

32
02:35.523 --> 02:41.169
Attention, this is the Company Commander. Morning roll call will be held indoors!

33
02:41.169 --> 02:43.189
Wondering why, since it's not raining?

34
02:43.189 --> 02:45.457
You must be tired from training.

35
02:45.457 --> 02:46.539
I know I am!

36
02:46.539 --> 02:49.893
So no outdoor roll call today. Indoors!

37
02:49.893 --> 02:53.129
Everybody, make some noise!

38
02:55.069 --> 02:56.289
Nice...

39
02:56.289 --> 02:59.054
Even the heavens are helping us until the very end.

40
02:59.054 --> 03:01.029
I know, right?

41
03:02.724 --> 03:04.695
[EP10. The Way Home]

42
03:04.695 --> 03:07.392
Why am I still hungry after breakfast?

43
03:10.101 --> 03:11.608
[Discharge D-1]

44
03:11.608 --> 03:15.155
Sweet! Double package star candies.

45
03:15.155 --> 03:16.740
Congratulations on the two stars.

46
03:16.740 --> 03:19.708
- You should buy a lottery ticket. - Bro, give me one!

47
03:20.429 --> 03:24.116
Your luck is peaking right before discharge.

48
03:25.469 --> 03:29.505
I bought it yesterday and already ran out. Damn.

49
03:33.797 --> 03:37.279
My bad luck is over. I'm on a roll.

50
03:40.660 --> 03:42.396
[Current Balance: 200 Won]

51
03:44.634 --> 03:47.541
Yes! Free coffee!

52
03:50.969 --> 03:56.319
What's with the line for the toilet? Did everyone have the burgers yesterday?

53
03:57.129 --> 04:01.562
Privates and Private First Classes, report to the admin office.

54
04:07.789 --> 04:10.589
- No Hee Jeong. - Corporal No Hee Jeong!

55
04:10.589 --> 04:12.961
- Is it today? - Yes, sir.

56
04:12.961 --> 04:16.828
- You kept asking to be a tennis soldier. - All thanks to you, Company Commander.

57
04:16.828 --> 04:19.569
I pulled some strings, so do your best.

58
04:19.569 --> 04:21.724
Don't flip me off behind my back!

59
04:21.724 --> 04:24.097
- I would never do that. - Right.

60
04:24.097 --> 04:26.369
The transport will be here soon, so be ready on time.

61
04:26.369 --> 04:27.989
- Yes, sir! - Okay.

62
04:27.989 --> 04:29.836
Keep up the good work.

63
04:34.749 --> 04:38.169
See? Dreams do come true.

64
04:38.169 --> 04:42.749
I'm going to make a big impact today and become the ultimate tennis soldier.

65
04:42.749 --> 04:44.029
Then I'll...

66
04:44.029 --> 04:46.134
You'll just be slaving away alone.

67
04:46.134 --> 04:49.709
What? Good luck, sir.

68
04:49.709 --> 04:52.251
Hey! Your senior is leaving, you know?

69
04:52.251 --> 04:56.408
Cheer me on with more energy! Try it again!

70
04:56.408 --> 04:58.969
Fighting!

71
04:58.969 --> 05:02.529
That's some high-energy cheering.

72
05:02.529 --> 05:05.709
I'm off! Boing, boing, boing!

73
05:05.709 --> 05:09.004
That's the spirit! I'm out of here!

74
05:17.119 --> 05:20.889
- Did you just flip me off? - No, sir. Just stretching my hands.

75
05:20.889 --> 05:23.779
I was trying to be like you.

76
05:26.285 --> 05:29.269
Trying to take an interest in tennis...

77
05:29.269 --> 05:31.748
I'm watching you... I'm going!

78
05:31.748 --> 05:33.775
Yes, have a good one!

79
05:37.304 --> 05:39.231
I'm so jealous...

80
05:46.109 --> 05:48.129
- You're tutoring me even today? - Yes, sir.

81
05:48.129 --> 05:50.709
Why are you helping me study until the day before discharge?

82
05:50.709 --> 05:52.855
The company commander exempted me from duties

83
05:52.855 --> 05:56.889
and told me to stay by Sergeant Kang to help him finish his CSAT prep.

84
05:56.889 --> 05:59.030
He said he'd look out for me until the end...

85
05:59.030 --> 06:01.329
I didn't think he'd go this far.

86
06:01.329 --> 06:03.209
This is the schedule.

87
06:03.209 --> 06:06.697
You can study according to this for the time you have left.

88
06:08.485 --> 06:11.273
I'm really grateful, Moon Bit Na Ri.

89
06:15.265 --> 06:16.265
What's this?

90
06:16.265 --> 06:19.110
I used to tutor at a study center before I enlisted.

91
06:19.110 --> 06:21.585
That's the name and number of the teacher there.

92
06:21.585 --> 06:27.365
I've already spoken to them, so call them for help after you're discharged.

93
06:27.365 --> 06:30.525
You didn't have to do all this...

94
06:30.525 --> 06:32.985
When I first joined the army,

95
06:32.985 --> 06:37.439
I had a hard time adjusting because of my panic attacks.

96
06:37.439 --> 06:39.093
But you helped me a lot.

97
06:39.093 --> 06:40.605
[Moon Bit Na Ri]

98
06:40.605 --> 06:42.274
Thank you!

99
06:46.194 --> 06:47.566
Here.

100
06:48.566 --> 06:50.745
- What's this? - A present.

101
06:50.745 --> 06:54.636
To Private Moon Bit Na Ri, one and only comrade of Se Gye.

102
06:54.636 --> 06:56.865
Hang in there a little longer.

103
06:56.865 --> 06:58.747
Yes, sir.

104
07:01.945 --> 07:03.265
What is this?

105
07:03.265 --> 07:06.256
When you're struggling so much you feel like dying...

106
07:07.010 --> 07:09.513
this knot will hold you tight.

107
07:12.307 --> 07:17.765
So I'm really happy and glad that I can be of help to someone.

108
07:17.765 --> 07:19.645
I haven't really done anything.

109
07:19.645 --> 07:23.825
No, sir! Especially since you postponed your discharge, Sergeant Kang.

110
07:23.825 --> 07:28.405
I heard all about your past from Corporal Ji Jeong Min.

111
07:28.405 --> 07:31.507
Ji Jeong Min? What did he tell you?

112
07:32.671 --> 07:36.265
About that... unpleasant incident.

113
07:36.265 --> 07:39.248
Ji Jeong Min... talking behind my back?

114
07:39.248 --> 07:42.379
- He said I sucked, huh? - That's right!

115
07:42.379 --> 07:44.585
Wait, no! It wasn't like that at all!

116
07:44.585 --> 07:48.343
Fine. I'll go back and show him my old self one last time.

117
07:48.343 --> 07:52.185
If you do that, you might not be able to go home tomorrow.

118
07:52.185 --> 07:53.645
Why you...

119
07:53.645 --> 07:57.440
But seeing you study so hard,

120
07:57.440 --> 07:59.725
I thought you were a really cool person.

121
07:59.725 --> 08:04.645
I want to spend the rest of my service being as cool as you, Sergeant Kang.

122
08:04.645 --> 08:09.125
- Like me? - I meant your current self, not the old one!

123
08:09.125 --> 08:14.365
- Bit Na Ri, aren't you a smooth talker now? - I learned it all here.

124
08:14.365 --> 08:17.085
It's good to see you've adjusted well.

125
08:17.085 --> 08:19.545
I'm really grateful, Moon Bit Na Ri.

126
08:19.545 --> 08:24.485
I'll definitely come visit with some good food after I take the CSAT.

127
08:24.485 --> 08:28.105
You have to! You have to come visit regularly!

128
08:28.105 --> 08:30.354
I will.

129
08:31.178 --> 08:35.345
- Are you slacking off here? - Slacking off? My foot.

130
08:35.345 --> 08:38.625
- Moon Bit Na Ri, skipping work to slack? - No, sir!

131
08:38.625 --> 08:41.445
The work I'm doing is very hard.

132
08:41.445 --> 08:43.745
Do you see any hope for the exam?

133
08:43.745 --> 08:48.465
Are you both mocking me? I'm just trying.

134
08:48.465 --> 08:52.532
But it's not easy to study and write an error note every single day.

135
08:52.532 --> 08:54.845
He's working very hard!

136
08:54.845 --> 08:59.164
Must've been so hard for Chan Seok. Look at all these wrong answers.

137
09:00.505 --> 09:02.505
There's just so much to study.

138
09:02.505 --> 09:08.627
You're used to writing apology letters, so I'm sure you're doing fine.

139
09:09.433 --> 09:11.171
That hurts...

140
09:11.825 --> 09:15.785
- That's cold, Dong Woo. - I'm just kidding. It's a joke.

141
09:15.785 --> 09:17.207
I need some time alone.

142
09:17.207 --> 09:20.635
I'm just kidding! Seriously!

143
09:21.433 --> 09:24.750
- Chungseong! Love you. - ♪ To our beloved... ♪

144
09:24.750 --> 09:26.205
What brings you here, sir?

145
09:26.205 --> 09:29.365
- To the multipurpose room? - I'm here to see Chan Seok.

146
09:29.365 --> 09:32.085
Chan Seok, you must've done something right.

147
09:32.085 --> 09:35.185
The guys are showing you so much love.

148
09:35.185 --> 09:37.035
What's this?

149
09:37.035 --> 09:40.969
They begged me to give this to you. Open it.

150
09:42.207 --> 09:43.891
What is all this?

151
09:43.891 --> 09:47.901
Il Gu and I bought those workbooks. Do them.

152
09:58.805 --> 10:00.885
I'm so touched.

153
10:00.885 --> 10:02.385
I never expected this.

154
10:02.385 --> 10:07.385
I never imagined you'd study for the CSAT, either. It was beyond my imagination.

155
10:07.385 --> 10:09.025
Thank you!

156
10:09.025 --> 10:11.602
Call me after the CSAT. Let's drink.

157
10:11.602 --> 10:13.315
Yes, sir.

158
10:14.365 --> 10:17.345
Thanks for looking out for me.

159
10:17.345 --> 10:19.930
If you're thankful, that'll be 500 won.

160
10:23.354 --> 10:24.764
Hey.

161
10:24.764 --> 10:27.991
I'm the one who's touched. Why are you crying?

162
10:30.405 --> 10:33.645
I don't know, I'm just tearing up.

163
10:33.645 --> 10:36.925
I feel a strong bond between all of us.

164
10:36.925 --> 10:39.531
Hey, hey, come on.

165
10:39.531 --> 10:41.309
But wait,

166
10:41.309 --> 10:45.103
shouldn't Sergeant Kang Chan Seok be the one crying?

167
10:45.103 --> 10:46.943
A man shouldn't cry over this.

168
10:46.943 --> 10:48.825
I guess you aren't touched enough.

169
10:48.825 --> 10:50.745
Should I have bought more?

170
10:50.745 --> 10:56.265
Come on, you should shed a tear considering all the effort we put in.

171
10:56.265 --> 10:58.324
I am touched.

172
10:58.324 --> 11:00.625
I just don't usually cry.

173
11:00.625 --> 11:02.912
I'm so sad I'm about to cry.

174
11:02.912 --> 11:05.133
We're leaving together, so what about me?

175
11:05.133 --> 11:07.058
- Where's my gift? - Here!

176
11:07.058 --> 11:10.809
- Oh? What's this? - It's your discharge gift, you punk!

177
11:11.588 --> 11:14.198
Snail cream.

178
11:16.085 --> 11:17.797
Thanks, guys.

179
11:17.797 --> 11:22.235
Get your civilian skin back and start dating.

180
11:23.055 --> 11:24.825
I'm the one who bought the snail cream.

181
11:24.825 --> 11:28.461
Sergeant Choi Byeong Nam! I'll keep my skin well-moisturized!

182
11:30.399 --> 11:32.814
Did you study much, Chan Seok?

183
11:32.814 --> 11:36.032
I tried, but I'm not sure.

184
11:37.114 --> 11:39.405
But if he works hard until the end,

185
11:39.405 --> 11:42.125
I think he can get a better grade than expected.

186
11:42.125 --> 11:44.613
Maybe a grade 4?

187
11:47.749 --> 11:49.538
Kang Chan Seok!

188
11:49.538 --> 11:52.848
- Kang Chan Seok! - Kang Chan Seok!

189
11:52.848 --> 11:54.840
- Kang Chan Seok! - Kang Chan Seok!

190
11:54.840 --> 11:59.225
- Why are you sulking again? - You big baby!

191
11:59.225 --> 12:03.917
- ♪ Sulky, sulky, sulky! ♪ - Choi Byeong Nam!

192
12:03.917 --> 12:07.517
- Choi Byeong Nam! - Choi Byeong Nam!

193
12:07.517 --> 12:11.898
- Choi Byeong Nam! - Choi Byeong Nam!

194
12:11.898 --> 12:17.849
- Choi Byeong Nam! - Choi Byeong Nam!

195
12:18.695 --> 12:20.835
Nice shot.

196
12:20.835 --> 12:23.315
One, two.

197
12:23.315 --> 12:25.085
Sir.

198
12:25.085 --> 12:26.966
Your backswing...

199
12:27.901 --> 12:29.134
Wow.

200
12:32.431 --> 12:34.495
Chungseong!

201
12:34.495 --> 12:37.195
Excuse me, sir.

202
12:37.195 --> 12:39.895
- Did you apply to be a tennis soldier? - Yes.

203
12:39.895 --> 12:43.135
- What was your original role? - I was an administrative clerk.

204
12:43.135 --> 12:45.795
A clerk... Why did you apply for this?

205
12:45.795 --> 12:48.255
- Because I like tennis. - It won't be easy.

206
12:48.255 --> 12:49.835
But being a clerk is tough too!

207
12:49.835 --> 12:51.255
- Really? - Yes.

208
12:51.255 --> 12:53.135
Here's what you must do every day.

209
12:53.135 --> 12:55.455
There's a lot of gravel on the court here.

210
12:55.455 --> 12:58.935
You have to check for it carefully. See these balls?

211
12:58.935 --> 13:00.674
You have to pick all of them up.

212
13:00.674 --> 13:03.775
There's trash in the drain too. You have to pick all of that up.

213
13:03.775 --> 13:07.375
The balls aren't just inside. They're outside too.

214
13:07.375 --> 13:09.955
You have to pull all the weeds.

215
13:09.955 --> 13:13.455
And if you go inside, the rackets are all over the place.

216
13:13.455 --> 13:15.975
You have to organize them all in a row.

217
13:15.975 --> 13:19.546
The key is to organize them by rank.

218
13:37.608 --> 13:38.855
I'm sorry!

219
13:38.855 --> 13:42.695
- I'm sorry! I'm sorry! - Hey! What are you doing? Get out!

220
13:42.695 --> 13:44.732
I'm sorry!

221
13:46.875 --> 13:50.495
- Tennis soldier! Get me some water. - Yes, sir!

222
13:51.587 --> 13:54.083
Why is this organized like this...

223
13:57.217 --> 13:59.458
Wait. Captain, then major. It's captain, then major.

224
13:59.458 --> 14:02.147
I'm even getting this mixed up now. Seriously...

225
14:06.141 --> 14:08.255
I can rest... I can rest...

226
14:08.255 --> 14:09.933
- Hey. - What?

227
14:09.933 --> 14:12.328
- What now? - If you're done, come here.

228
14:12.328 --> 14:15.389
Hurry, hurry!

229
14:15.389 --> 14:17.135
Where to?

230
14:17.135 --> 14:20.875
You know generals and their wives come here, right?

231
14:20.875 --> 14:24.360
- Yes. - If we run out of this, it's a disaster.

232
14:26.175 --> 14:29.075
Fill the freezer with ice water.

233
14:29.075 --> 14:30.204
This is driving me crazy.

234
14:30.204 --> 14:32.204
Close it and come here!

235
14:36.955 --> 14:40.005
And if you organize all the sneakers one by one...

236
14:40.005 --> 14:42.048
Then, you're all set!

237
14:42.835 --> 14:46.442
But... if it rains...

238
14:51.235 --> 14:56.015
Then you take down the nets, roll them up, and bring them inside.

239
14:56.015 --> 14:58.899
- Okay? - Okay...

240
14:58.899 --> 15:01.235
Why is it suddenly raining now?

241
15:01.235 --> 15:04.926
- What are you doing? Get out there! - Yes.

242
15:04.926 --> 15:06.673
I'll have to hurry.

243
15:10.118 --> 15:12.288
Who tied this...

244
15:15.091 --> 15:17.083
Why are you only talking?

245
15:17.083 --> 15:18.544
What did you say?

246
15:18.544 --> 15:20.045
Can't you help me?

247
15:20.045 --> 15:22.295
I really want to help you,

248
15:22.295 --> 15:25.049
but I'm a former pro. They told me not to do this so I don't get hurt.

249
15:25.049 --> 15:28.275
Former pro, my foot. You won't get sick from a little rain.

250
15:28.275 --> 15:30.295
- Hey, I can hear you. - Yes...

251
15:30.295 --> 15:32.955
- Stop grumbling and hurry up. - Yes!

252
15:32.955 --> 15:35.727
They'll nag if the nets get wet and rot.

253
15:35.727 --> 15:37.813
- Do the other side too. - I'm done.

254
15:37.813 --> 15:40.048
- Okay? - Okay, okay!

255
15:50.095 --> 15:51.295
Hey.

256
15:51.295 --> 15:53.039
Hey!

257
15:53.039 --> 15:54.659
- It stopped raining. - Yes, it did.

258
15:54.659 --> 15:56.595
Set up the net! Hurry up! Come out, hurry, hurry!

259
15:56.595 --> 15:59.387
- Hurry! - Set up the net... Set up the net...

260
16:01.395 --> 16:03.032
Hurry up!

261
16:21.791 --> 16:23.915
Can't you help me pick up the balls?

262
16:23.915 --> 16:26.391
You keep hitting them, so I have to pick them up again.

263
16:26.391 --> 16:28.535
I really want to help you,

264
16:28.535 --> 16:31.775
but the Operations Officer will be here any minute.

265
16:31.775 --> 16:33.951
Go outside and drain the puddles.

266
16:33.951 --> 16:35.175
Okay.

267
16:37.994 --> 16:39.835
- Chungseong! - Chungseong.

268
16:39.835 --> 16:42.936
- Sir, how about backhands today? - Sure.

269
16:42.936 --> 16:44.975
Won Gyu. Check my form.

270
16:44.975 --> 16:47.675
Just a moment, sir. I'll check it right away.

271
16:47.675 --> 16:52.043
- What are you doing? Hurry up. - Okay...

272
16:55.035 --> 16:58.575
Sir, once you're ready, stand in the middle and I'll feed you.

273
16:58.575 --> 17:00.755
One, two.

274
17:02.535 --> 17:04.857
How will I cope without you once you're discharged?

275
17:04.857 --> 17:07.824
- You're lying. - No, I'm serious.

276
17:07.824 --> 17:09.445
Are the soon-to-be civilians here?

277
17:09.445 --> 17:12.235
- Sergeant Choi Byeong Nam! - Sergeant Kang Chan Seok!

278
17:12.235 --> 17:14.572
- Chungseong! Love you! - Right! Love you too.

279
17:14.572 --> 17:15.953
- Dong Woo. - Corporal Kim Dong Woo.

280
17:15.953 --> 17:18.975
The soon-to-be civilians are exempt from dinner tonight.

281
17:18.975 --> 17:21.113
- Understood. - Are you treating us?

282
17:21.113 --> 17:23.635
Why would I buy you something good when you're leaving?

283
17:23.635 --> 17:26.995
I'm just going to feed you something unhealthy before you go.

284
17:26.995 --> 17:30.435
- That's more than okay! - Company Commander, love you!

285
17:30.435 --> 17:32.195
Sir, can we come along too?

286
17:32.195 --> 17:33.735
Come when you're discharged.

287
17:33.735 --> 17:36.055
Sir, I still have a long way to go.

288
17:36.055 --> 17:38.538
I'll call you when I'm ready, so come running.

289
17:38.538 --> 17:40.218
- Understood! - Understood!

290
17:40.218 --> 17:41.685
Good luck, sir!

291
17:41.685 --> 17:43.524
Man, I'm so jealous.

292
17:44.471 --> 17:46.855
I'm really envious.

293
17:46.855 --> 17:49.819
I'm more jealous of your dinner than your discharge.

294
17:49.819 --> 17:52.534
If you're awake, I'll let you smell the booze.

295
17:52.534 --> 17:54.288
Buddion.

296
17:55.155 --> 17:56.815
Well, we'll go have dinner.

297
17:56.815 --> 17:58.395
- Let's go! - Yes, sir!

298
17:58.395 --> 18:01.355
- Enjoy your meal. - Enjoy your dinner, sir!

299
18:01.355 --> 18:05.434
Eat plenty of that mess hall food. You'll definitely miss it later.

300
18:10.755 --> 18:14.215
Man, this day finally came.

301
18:14.215 --> 18:15.845
It doesn't feel real.

302
18:15.845 --> 18:19.275
So many things happened...

303
18:19.275 --> 18:23.312
- Will we miss this place once we're out? - We definitely will.

304
18:23.312 --> 18:24.700
Yeah.

305
18:31.236 --> 18:34.345
Chungseong! Corporal Sung Yoon Mo. I'm here on business for Barracks 3.

306
18:34.345 --> 18:35.405
Company Commander?

307
18:35.405 --> 18:37.865
- Yes, sir. - Let's go.

308
18:37.865 --> 18:39.649
Okay.

309
18:40.785 --> 18:44.225
Company Commander, I knew he'd call for us.

310
18:44.225 --> 18:47.014
Chungseong! Love you! I'm so jealous!

311
18:52.423 --> 18:54.385
Man, I hope there's jokbal.

312
18:54.385 --> 18:56.105
I want pizza and chicken.

313
18:56.105 --> 18:59.597
I should've eaten less for lunch.

314
19:01.685 --> 19:03.957
I'm going to feast.

315
19:05.485 --> 19:07.845
Company Commander!

316
19:07.845 --> 19:11.869
He's not here. Where did he go?

317
19:14.785 --> 19:16.936
Huh? What's this?

318
19:33.865 --> 19:35.945
Am I seeing things?

319
19:35.945 --> 19:38.620
Right? Me too.

320
19:47.229 --> 19:48.979
It's not a hallucination.

321
19:48.979 --> 19:51.191
We've been set up, haven't we?

322
19:51.191 --> 19:53.818
I think so.

323
19:53.818 --> 19:55.341
Wait a second.

324
19:59.483 --> 20:02.426
Sung Yoon Mo! Sung Yoon Mo!

325
20:05.117 --> 20:09.375
- Sung Yoon Mo, you son of a bitch! - Congratulations on your discharge!

326
20:10.252 --> 20:12.388
This isn't what I expected.

327
20:13.525 --> 20:16.097
Sergeant Kang Chan Seok.

328
20:16.097 --> 20:17.656
Dong Woo.

329
20:23.125 --> 20:26.725
Tell me. Why did you do that to me?

330
20:26.725 --> 20:28.425
Fine.

331
20:28.425 --> 20:30.957
I'll take the beating like a man.

332
20:33.785 --> 20:36.285
Park Min Seok. You really went all out.

333
20:36.285 --> 20:39.145
I'm just following Sergeant Shim Jin Woo's lead.

334
20:39.145 --> 20:42.565
Se Gye, you know I gave you my yellow quilted liner, right?

335
20:42.565 --> 20:46.028
You worked hard, Byeong Nam.

336
20:46.871 --> 20:51.375
- No one I can trust in this world! - Let's do this!

337
20:51.375 --> 20:52.685
Bring it on!

338
20:52.685 --> 20:55.241
Come at me, you bastards!

339
20:56.425 --> 20:57.705
Relax your body!

340
20:57.705 --> 20:59.185
Damn it!

341
20:59.185 --> 21:01.590
Come on!

342
21:12.231 --> 21:14.537
My bones are breaking! They're breaking!

343
21:14.537 --> 21:16.124
Goodbye, Byeong Nam!

344
21:16.124 --> 21:19.124
Stay away! Stay away from me!

345
21:25.916 --> 21:28.185
Man, they went all out.

346
21:28.185 --> 21:31.225
I'm disappointed in you, Company Commander, for the first time.

347
21:31.225 --> 21:34.805
If it weren't for you, I could've avoided the discharge beating.

348
21:34.805 --> 21:37.712
What can I do? The guys asked me nicely.

349
21:39.466 --> 21:40.867
Here.

350
21:44.304 --> 21:46.829
Look at this and forget it.

351
21:50.465 --> 21:53.358
Company Commander, your words are always the truth.

352
21:53.358 --> 21:55.876
I'm already over it.

353
22:01.111 --> 22:02.685
Sergeant Choi Byeong Nam.

354
22:02.685 --> 22:04.717
How do you feel?

355
22:06.994 --> 22:10.725
- It's killer, sir. - No, I mean how do you feel about leaving?

356
22:10.725 --> 22:14.169
Sorry. This is just so thrilling.

357
22:16.425 --> 22:19.165
- It hasn't really sunk in yet. - You, Chan Seok?

358
22:19.165 --> 22:21.549
I'm not sure either.

359
22:21.549 --> 22:25.912
I feel like I'll be in this uniform doing roll calls tomorrow.

360
22:27.525 --> 22:30.905
Falling asleep to the sound of guys snoring.

361
22:30.905 --> 22:34.473
And waking up to Se Gye's voice in the morning.

362
22:35.229 --> 22:37.745
Feel like I'll just keep living like that.

363
22:37.745 --> 22:40.694
You've spent so much time here.

364
22:40.694 --> 22:42.845
Not easy for it to feel real right away.

365
22:42.845 --> 22:46.467
Especially for Chan Seok, who served longer than the others.

366
22:47.165 --> 22:49.990
Oh, stop it, sir.

367
22:51.605 --> 22:54.300
- Let me pour you a drink. - Sure, go ahead.

368
23:04.045 --> 23:05.604
Thank you!

369
23:10.325 --> 23:12.149
To be honest, all this time...

370
23:12.967 --> 23:17.395
I've had a lot of regrets.

371
23:18.925 --> 23:21.413
But you've been good since then.

372
23:21.413 --> 23:23.645
I learned a lot watching him.

373
23:23.645 --> 23:29.100
No matter how good I am now, it doesn't erase what happened.

374
23:30.685 --> 23:32.842
True...

375
23:32.842 --> 23:35.145
When you're in the military,

376
23:35.145 --> 23:38.792
you often regret things you did back then.

377
23:38.792 --> 23:40.209
[Incident / Accident Report]

378
23:40.905 --> 23:46.811
Strangely, some things only become clear after time has passed.

379
23:47.485 --> 23:51.497
Once the end is in sight,

380
23:51.497 --> 23:54.558
your daily routine and everything you see every day...

381
23:54.558 --> 23:56.233
Go!

382
23:58.245 --> 24:00.366
start to feel precious.

383
24:02.985 --> 24:04.935
Isn't that how it is?

384
24:04.935 --> 24:09.543
Yes, exactly. That's how I feel right now.

385
24:09.543 --> 24:12.665
You sound like you're the one getting discharged, Company Commander.

386
24:12.665 --> 24:14.025
Really?

387
24:17.425 --> 24:19.001
I'll have to leave someday too.

388
24:19.001 --> 24:22.845
No, sir. We need people like you, Company Commander.

389
24:22.845 --> 24:25.825
That's right. You have to stay, no matter what!

390
24:25.825 --> 24:30.774
I buy you soju and jokbal, and I get all these compliments?

391
24:32.905 --> 24:34.368
Company Commander.

392
24:35.028 --> 24:39.085
Now that I'm actually leaving, I'm scared.

393
24:39.085 --> 24:41.895
Why? Can't you see the path ahead?

394
24:41.895 --> 24:47.203
I said I'd take the CSAT, but I'm afraid.

395
24:47.883 --> 24:50.948
Just go. Follow your feet.

396
24:50.948 --> 24:52.935
With the person you are now, Chan Seok,

397
24:52.935 --> 24:56.747
I don't think those feet will lead you to the wrong place.

398
24:56.747 --> 24:58.415
Just give it a go!

399
24:58.415 --> 25:04.165
Wherever your feet take you will become your path, Chan Seok.

400
25:05.005 --> 25:08.050
- Company Commander, what was that? - What?

401
25:08.050 --> 25:10.718
I just got goosebumps.

402
25:10.718 --> 25:12.641
Are you a poet or something?

403
25:13.345 --> 25:16.081
I've always been a sentimental guy.

404
25:16.862 --> 25:22.125
I'm rooting for you both, Chan Seok and Byeong Nam.

405
25:22.125 --> 25:23.705
- Thank you! - Thank you, sir!

406
25:23.705 --> 25:25.439
I love you guys!

407
25:29.025 --> 25:32.445
Company Commander, can I come visit you after I'm discharged?

408
25:32.445 --> 25:35.145
Everyone says that, but no one does.

409
25:35.145 --> 25:38.285
I'm a man of my word.

410
25:38.285 --> 25:40.807
What should I call you then, Company Commander?

411
25:40.807 --> 25:42.933
What do you want to call me?

412
25:44.628 --> 25:46.697
Uncle Baek Ho?

413
25:46.697 --> 25:48.049
Uncle?

414
25:48.715 --> 25:50.765
- Brother Baek Ho? - Are you crazy?

415
25:50.765 --> 25:52.520
I'm sorry!

416
25:53.237 --> 25:57.285
Tell you what. If you actually visit, I'll let you call me Brother Baek Ho!

417
25:57.285 --> 25:59.635
Thank you!

418
26:00.532 --> 26:03.324
- Come in. - Entering.

419
26:07.605 --> 26:09.145
Chungseong! Love you.

420
26:09.145 --> 26:12.529
Corporal Kim Dong Woo reporting to the commander's office. My business is...

421
26:12.529 --> 26:14.997
I'm here to get a drink from you.

422
26:14.997 --> 26:17.025
Yes, I called Dong Woo over.

423
26:17.025 --> 26:18.665
- Come here and sit down! - Yes, sir!

424
26:18.665 --> 26:22.122
You worked hard as a squad leader with these two seniors.

425
26:22.122 --> 26:24.477
You deserve a drink for your hard work! Right?

426
26:24.477 --> 26:25.542
Thank you, sir.

427
26:25.542 --> 26:26.765
Company Commander?

428
26:26.765 --> 26:29.582
I don't think one drink will be enough.

429
26:30.605 --> 26:33.325
- Let's all drink together. - Yes, sir.

430
26:33.325 --> 26:36.387
Wait. Did I drink too much?

431
26:36.387 --> 26:38.105
I need to use the bathroom.

432
26:38.105 --> 26:41.143
And just at this very moment!

433
26:41.143 --> 26:44.083
Don't you need to go too, Byeong Nam?

434
26:44.083 --> 26:45.841
I'm fine...

435
26:47.685 --> 26:49.458
I also, just at this very moment,

436
26:49.458 --> 26:52.745
magically need to go! Let's go together, sir.

437
26:52.745 --> 26:54.112
Right, let's go.

438
26:54.112 --> 26:55.666
You two have a drink.

439
26:55.666 --> 26:57.353
Yes, sir!

440
26:59.931 --> 27:01.671
Don't fight.

441
27:01.671 --> 27:03.445
Hurry up, you punk.

442
27:04.333 --> 27:07.178
- Have a cigarette. - Thank you, sir!

443
27:08.205 --> 27:12.646
Man, once you leave, the unit is going to be so quiet.

444
27:12.646 --> 27:14.626
You'll definitely feel the void.

445
27:14.626 --> 27:16.745
It won't be easy once you're out.

446
27:16.745 --> 27:18.720
We prepared for war here,

447
27:18.720 --> 27:22.720
but out there, it's literally a battlefield.

448
27:22.720 --> 27:23.838
I'm prepared for it.

449
27:23.838 --> 27:27.425
No matter what anyone says, never lose your confidence!

450
27:27.425 --> 27:30.025
Keep talking smoothly as you do now,

451
27:30.025 --> 27:34.778
and live well as the Byeong Nam who makes people happy!

452
27:34.778 --> 27:37.625
Nothing is more important than that in life.

453
27:37.625 --> 27:41.648
Yes, sir! I'll live my life as an even smoother talker.

454
27:43.956 --> 27:45.748
Byeong Nam...

455
27:46.685 --> 27:48.460
You really worked hard.

456
27:48.460 --> 27:49.921
Thank you, sir!

457
27:51.505 --> 27:53.776
- Give me a cigarette. - Here it is!

458
27:55.845 --> 27:57.525
Wait, was that my last one?

459
27:57.525 --> 28:00.879
- Should I give you mine? - You had cigarettes but smoked mine?

460
28:03.056 --> 28:04.601
I think I left them behind.

461
28:04.601 --> 28:08.792
Has there ever been a soldier who went to the brig the day before discharge?

462
28:08.792 --> 28:11.445
Why are you being like this?

463
28:11.445 --> 28:13.944
I'll give you two cigarettes.

464
28:13.944 --> 28:16.918
Fine! No brig for you!

465
28:16.918 --> 28:18.145
Thank you!

466
28:18.145 --> 28:20.379
Give me a light.

467
28:26.123 --> 28:29.403
I'm leaving with good memories thanks to you, Company Commander.

468
28:32.546 --> 28:34.220
Thanks.

469
28:57.471 --> 28:59.303
Shall we have...

470
28:59.303 --> 29:03.118
- a drink? - No, sir.

471
29:03.118 --> 29:04.547
What?

472
29:05.645 --> 29:08.407
You should give me at least ten drinks.

473
29:10.525 --> 29:13.562
- Here. - Corporal Kim Dong Woo, thank you!

474
29:14.625 --> 29:17.004
- Pour me one too. - Yes, sir.

475
29:17.799 --> 29:19.885
You've really worked hard, sir.

476
29:19.885 --> 29:21.569
I'm really sorry for what I did to you.

477
29:21.569 --> 29:23.972
Not again.

478
29:23.972 --> 29:26.265
You really don't have to be.

479
29:30.285 --> 29:32.945
Looking back,

480
29:32.945 --> 29:37.483
I think I was able to grow a lot through those times.

481
29:38.153 --> 29:39.903
Are you sorry?

482
29:39.903 --> 29:42.406
- Are you sorry? - Private First Class Kim Dong Woo.

483
29:42.406 --> 29:44.085
Yet you reported me?

484
29:44.085 --> 29:46.351
I don't care anymore, you punk!

485
29:46.351 --> 29:48.288
Corporal Kang Chan Seok, that really hurts! Really!

486
29:48.288 --> 29:50.585
- Kim Dong Woo. - Private First Class Kim Dong Woo.

487
29:50.585 --> 29:52.886
I'm sorry. I'm really sorry.

488
29:52.886 --> 29:54.855
I'm sorry, Dong Woo.

489
30:02.386 --> 30:05.105
Corporal Kang Chan Seok, are you okay?

490
30:06.085 --> 30:09.006
- Kim Dong Woo. - Private First Class Kim Dong Woo.

491
30:10.934 --> 30:12.354
It's funny...

492
30:12.354 --> 30:17.345
It's true that I had a hard time because of you, Sergeant Kang,

493
30:17.345 --> 30:22.017
but thanks to you, I was also...

494
30:23.323 --> 30:25.948
able to overcome it.

495
30:26.742 --> 30:29.387
I guess I gave you the disease and the cure.

496
30:29.387 --> 30:31.705
- I'm really sorry. - It's okay.

497
30:31.705 --> 30:36.173
The disease was painful and the cure was bitter,

498
30:36.173 --> 30:38.375
but it's really okay.

499
30:39.785 --> 30:41.205
Please forgive me.

500
30:41.205 --> 30:45.731
How about a drink of this bitter but good medicine, then?

501
30:46.430 --> 30:48.297
I'm truly sorry.

502
30:49.556 --> 30:53.065
If you drink this, you're not allowed to feel sorry anymore.

503
30:53.065 --> 30:56.184
What's this? Are you Jung Woo Sung?

504
30:59.845 --> 31:02.080
You really don't have to be.

505
31:03.525 --> 31:05.945
Thank you, Dong Woo.

506
31:05.945 --> 31:10.923
See? "Thank you" sounds much better than "I'm sorry."

507
31:11.622 --> 31:13.618
Thank you so much.

508
31:13.618 --> 31:15.517
I learned a lot.

509
31:20.225 --> 31:21.840
Let's drink.

510
31:21.840 --> 31:23.905
You've worked hard.

511
31:36.205 --> 31:38.190
Here, have some food too.

512
31:38.190 --> 31:41.368
Oh... Thank you again!

513
32:03.757 --> 32:05.482
No Hee Jeong?

514
32:05.482 --> 32:07.135
Corporal No Hee Jeong...

515
32:07.135 --> 32:09.719
- Please save me... - What's wrong with you?

516
32:09.719 --> 32:12.307
Weren't you supposed to be a tennis soldier starting today?

517
32:12.307 --> 32:15.905
Yes, sir. But could you please cancel my tennis soldier duty?

518
32:15.905 --> 32:18.305
- What? - Company Commander... please... please...

519
32:18.305 --> 32:20.525
Please save me just this once.

520
32:20.525 --> 32:22.526
I had no idea it would be this hard.

521
32:22.526 --> 32:24.286
I didn't know...

522
32:24.286 --> 32:26.093
My legs are shaking...

523
32:26.093 --> 32:28.699
Company Commander, I didn't know I'd do this after work hours too.

524
32:28.699 --> 32:31.118
It's in the official notice. How did you miss it?

525
32:31.118 --> 32:32.435
It really wasn't there.

526
32:32.435 --> 32:34.485
Company Commander, please save me just this once.

527
32:34.485 --> 32:36.605
It's not a matter of saving you or not.

528
32:36.605 --> 32:38.125
I really didn't know.

529
32:38.125 --> 32:40.214
I'll work hard on administrative duties...

530
32:40.214 --> 32:42.379
- Please save me. - Go to the brig then.

531
32:42.379 --> 32:45.845
Company Commander!

532
32:45.845 --> 32:49.009
Company Commander!

533
32:54.700 --> 32:56.346
You little punk!

534
32:56.346 --> 32:57.807
Wait... I wasn't laughing!

535
32:57.807 --> 32:59.434
What do you mean you weren't laughing? You bastard!

536
32:59.434 --> 33:02.049
No, I really wasn't laughing!

537
33:02.049 --> 33:03.270
Please calm down!

538
33:03.270 --> 33:05.836
I just wanted to play tennis...

539
33:14.703 --> 33:16.517
Neat appearance.

540
33:17.623 --> 33:21.845
[Discharge D-Day]

541
33:21.845 --> 33:25.297
Finally, this tiresome life is coming to an end.

542
33:25.297 --> 33:26.855
I know, right?

543
33:32.192 --> 33:34.973
You guys are told to come out.

544
33:34.973 --> 33:36.622
Okay!

545
33:39.197 --> 33:41.605
Se Gye, about that blind date we talked about...

546
33:41.605 --> 33:45.555
- Did we ever talk about that? - Oh, come on.

547
34:08.140 --> 34:10.634
Wait a second.

548
34:10.634 --> 34:12.913
Hey! Hurry up!

549
34:15.013 --> 34:16.561
Bye.

550
34:23.895 --> 34:26.385
I should call you Brother Se Gye now, right?

551
34:26.385 --> 34:30.279
[Barracks 2] Call me whatever you want, Byeong Nam!

552
34:30.279 --> 34:32.529
I feel strange.

553
34:32.529 --> 34:35.445
[October Birthday List]

554
34:35.445 --> 34:39.278
It's an emotion I want to express, but can't put into words.

555
34:39.278 --> 34:41.617
[Defend our nation. Fulfill your duty!]

556
34:44.225 --> 34:46.777
[Company Commander's Office] After all this time,

557
34:46.777 --> 34:49.565
those of you who have walked this path,

558
34:49.565 --> 34:52.199
I wonder how you would express it.

559
34:53.825 --> 34:58.648
I wonder how you felt at this moment.

560
35:16.065 --> 35:18.014
Chungseong! Love you!

561
35:18.014 --> 35:20.162
Chungseong! Love you!

562
35:20.162 --> 35:24.445
Before our two veterans report out, shall we hear a few words?

563
35:24.445 --> 35:27.113
- Byeong Nam first! - Yes, sir!

564
35:28.924 --> 35:31.745
At first, I thought time would never pass...

565
35:31.745 --> 35:35.855
But looking back... it really didn't pass!

566
35:37.905 --> 35:39.912
I'm leaving first. Good luck, suckers!

567
35:39.912 --> 35:43.905
- Boo! - You punks.

568
35:43.905 --> 35:46.720
- Chan Seok too. - Yes, sir!

569
36:14.339 --> 36:16.510
What, are you crying?

570
36:16.510 --> 36:18.105
Are you actually crying?

571
36:18.105 --> 36:20.101
Hey, would he cry?

572
36:20.101 --> 36:23.809
He's the type to bleed, but never shed a tear.

573
36:23.809 --> 36:25.991
Are you crying?

574
36:34.645 --> 36:36.756
If you cry, then I'll...

575
36:54.006 --> 36:55.734
Come on.

576
36:56.373 --> 36:59.556
Dong Woo, I'm sorry...

577
37:01.133 --> 37:03.106
I'm really sorry...

578
37:06.533 --> 37:08.066
This guy...

579
37:08.066 --> 37:09.563
Seriously.

580
37:09.563 --> 37:11.396
Don't cry!

581
37:11.396 --> 37:16.945
- Don't cry! - Don't cry!

582
37:16.945 --> 37:21.033
- Don't cry! - Don't cry!

583
37:21.033 --> 37:22.951
Damn it...

584
37:22.951 --> 37:27.313
Why do I only remember the bad things now that I'm leaving?

585
37:27.313 --> 37:29.080
I'm sorry, guys.

586
37:29.080 --> 37:32.553
Sergeant Kang Chan Seok! Don't cry!

587
37:32.553 --> 37:36.931
You two were the best seniors I ever had!

588
37:38.913 --> 37:42.284
I had fun thanks to you guys! Take care.

589
37:44.056 --> 37:46.312
I'll keep in touch!

590
37:48.493 --> 37:52.085
Chan Seok! Don't get into trouble!

591
37:54.359 --> 37:56.353
Thanks.

592
37:56.353 --> 38:00.577
I'll leave my regrets here and only take the gratitude with me.

593
38:01.193 --> 38:03.036
Thank you so much.

594
38:05.365 --> 38:09.924
- Good job! - You worked hard!

595
38:12.290 --> 38:14.733
Shall we get started?

596
38:14.733 --> 38:16.113
- Yes, sir! - Yes, sir!

597
38:16.113 --> 38:19.453
- To your positions! - To your positions!

598
38:19.453 --> 38:20.553
Where are you going?

599
38:20.553 --> 38:23.147
- Hey, limo! - Yes!

600
38:30.352 --> 38:35.659
Hey! I shouldn't laugh while crying, but what is this?

601
38:36.754 --> 38:39.359
It's a discharge convertible! We'll give you a safe ride!

602
38:39.359 --> 38:45.333
This is a special service for the two best seniors who even postponed their discharge!

603
38:45.333 --> 38:50.213
We didn't have this when I was discharged. I prepared this myself!

604
38:50.213 --> 38:52.513
- Give them a safe ride! - Get in!

605
38:52.513 --> 38:54.081
Please get in.

606
38:54.081 --> 38:56.292
Get in! We'll take you safely!

607
38:56.292 --> 38:58.550
- Hold on tight! - Yes, sir!

608
39:00.716 --> 39:02.843
I'm going to die before I even get home!

609
39:02.843 --> 39:04.704
All right, let's go!

610
39:06.689 --> 39:08.162
Let's go!

611
39:08.162 --> 39:09.733
[Congratulations on Discharge]

612
39:09.733 --> 39:11.680
Lift it up, lift it up!

613
39:13.156 --> 39:14.705
Chungseong! Love you!

614
39:14.705 --> 39:15.953
Congratulations on your discharge!

615
39:15.953 --> 39:17.773
- Take care! - Yeah.

616
39:17.773 --> 39:20.888
- How's the ride? - It's awesome.

617
39:20.888 --> 39:23.572
- Visit! Visit! Visit! - Visit! Visit! Visit!

618
39:23.572 --> 39:24.907
Sergeant Kang Chan Seok!

619
39:24.907 --> 39:26.301
No!

620
39:31.596 --> 39:34.262
- Congratulations on your discharge! - Thanks.

621
39:34.262 --> 39:36.496
What do we do now?

622
39:37.608 --> 39:42.348
- Overnight! Overnight! - Overnight! Overnight!

623
39:43.437 --> 39:45.037
- Cheers! - Cheers!

624
39:45.037 --> 39:46.953
- Love you! - Love you!

625
39:46.953 --> 39:48.868
Hey, you punk.

626
39:54.978 --> 39:56.651
Are you ready?

627
39:58.188 --> 40:00.154
Unit, attention!

628
40:00.154 --> 40:01.525
Salute the Company Commander!

629
40:01.525 --> 40:03.573
- Chungseong! Love you! - Chungseong! Love you!

630
40:03.573 --> 40:05.528
Chungseong! Love you!

631
40:05.528 --> 40:07.015
At ease!

632
40:07.015 --> 40:10.453
- Reporting, Sergeant Kang Chan Seok. - Sergeant Choi Byeong Nam.

633
40:10.453 --> 40:13.653
As of October 16, 2012, we have been ordered to discharge.

634
40:13.653 --> 40:16.414
We hereby report. Salute the Company Commander!

635
40:16.414 --> 40:18.093
- Chungseong! Love you! - Chungseong! Love you!

636
40:18.093 --> 40:20.168
Chungseong! Love you.

637
40:20.168 --> 40:22.033
At ease!

638
40:22.033 --> 40:25.433
- Chan Seok, you worked hard. - Sergeant Kang Chan Seok! Thank you!

639
40:25.433 --> 40:28.433
Byeong Nam, you worked hard too!

640
40:28.433 --> 40:32.310
Everyone, Chan Seok and Byeong Nam are going home now.

641
40:37.479 --> 40:39.711
Hey, sign up to be a professional sergeant!

642
40:39.711 --> 40:41.693
- You worked hard. I'll keep in touch. - You worked hard!

643
40:41.693 --> 40:44.207
- Contact me when you're out. I'll buy food! - You worked hard!

644
40:44.207 --> 40:45.870
If life is hard, apply for professional sergeant.

645
40:45.870 --> 40:47.644
Yes, sir.

646
40:47.644 --> 40:50.031
Bro Chan Seok, you worked hard.

647
40:52.913 --> 40:55.390
You worked hard, man.

648
40:55.390 --> 40:58.021
You worked hard! Good job!

649
41:05.336 --> 41:08.611
[You worked hard]

650
41:09.652 --> 41:11.971
First Sergeant!

651
41:11.971 --> 41:13.824
[3 hours ago]

652
41:13.824 --> 41:16.673
Why are we weeding in the morning?

653
41:16.673 --> 41:20.593
The First Sergeant said we should clean up since the guys are going home.

654
41:20.593 --> 41:24.153
I'm so jealous they're discharging.

655
41:24.153 --> 41:26.133
I wonder how it feels.

656
41:26.133 --> 41:28.713
- I wonder if that day will ever come. - You punks.

657
41:28.713 --> 41:30.991
Stop grumbling and pack the weeds.

658
41:30.991 --> 41:34.013
- We have to prepare for their departure. - Yes, sir.

659
41:34.013 --> 41:37.742
- Let's finish quickly and go eat. - Yes, sir.

660
41:38.872 --> 41:41.713
- Freeze! - Freeze.

661
41:41.713 --> 41:43.073
What's wrong, First Sergeant?

662
41:43.073 --> 41:46.433
Do this later. Go and get ready for their departure.

663
41:46.433 --> 41:47.613
Right now, sir?

664
41:47.613 --> 41:50.774
You can do it later! I said go! Go! Go!

665
41:50.774 --> 41:53.781
- Yes, sir! - Yes, sir! Let's go!

666
41:53.781 --> 41:55.343
Sweet.

667
41:55.343 --> 41:57.419
- Hey, leave the cart. - Leave it here?

668
41:57.419 --> 41:59.816
- Go. - Yes, sir.

669
42:09.351 --> 42:14.533
[You worked hard]

670
42:17.275 --> 42:19.661
First Sergeant!

671
42:21.013 --> 42:24.088
Don't just look for easy paths out there.

672
42:24.088 --> 42:26.313
Where's the fun in only easy paths?

673
42:26.313 --> 42:28.921
Even if it's tough and rough like a weed,

674
42:28.921 --> 42:31.513
make sure you survive anywhere.

675
42:31.513 --> 42:34.773
Don't give up, just like in the military!

676
42:34.773 --> 42:37.879
If you do that, flowers will eventually bloom.

677
42:37.879 --> 42:39.497
Don't you think?

678
42:40.233 --> 42:43.633
- Kang Chan Seok! - Sergeant Kang Chan Seok!

679
42:43.633 --> 42:46.834
- Choi Byeong Nam! - Sergeant Choi Byeong Nam!

680
42:47.573 --> 42:50.613
You punks, you really worked hard.

681
42:50.613 --> 42:52.445
Work hard out there too.

682
42:52.445 --> 42:55.573
Work really hard, you hear me?

683
42:55.573 --> 42:57.436
Thank you, sir.

684
42:57.436 --> 43:01.483
Alright, head home now!

685
43:08.364 --> 43:11.957
- Bye! - Sign up as a professional sergeant!

686
43:11.957 --> 43:13.177
You worked hard!

687
43:13.177 --> 43:16.389
- You worked hard! - Hey, sign up as a professional sergeant!

688
43:20.123 --> 43:21.516
Come visit us!

689
43:21.516 --> 43:24.410
- We can't go any further. - You worked hard, sir!

690
43:24.410 --> 43:25.927
We're off!

691
43:29.497 --> 43:32.005
- I'm so jealous! - Take care!

692
43:37.977 --> 43:41.479
- Take care, guys... - They're really gone.

693
43:45.506 --> 43:47.040
Let's head back in.

694
43:47.040 --> 43:49.585
- Yes, sir. - Yes, sir.

695
43:49.585 --> 43:52.685
- Chungseong! Love you! - Chungseong! Love you.

696
43:53.757 --> 43:56.818
How did you think of doing all that?

697
43:57.577 --> 44:01.391
Well, I just... wanted to give those boys

698
44:01.391 --> 44:04.402
some good memories after all their hard work.

699
44:05.103 --> 44:07.937
I learned something from you again today, First Sergeant.

700
44:07.937 --> 44:09.775
Please. It was nothing.

701
44:09.775 --> 44:12.597
Right! Isn't the promotion announcement today?

702
44:12.597 --> 44:14.071
Yes.

703
44:14.071 --> 44:16.330
Don't worry too much. It'll go well.

704
44:16.330 --> 44:18.257
I'm not worried.

705
44:18.257 --> 44:20.877
Didn't you tell me before, First Sergeant?

706
44:20.877 --> 44:24.777
What's meant to happen will happen, whether you worry or not.

707
44:24.777 --> 44:27.358
- I'll be in touch. - Yes, alright.

708
44:29.944 --> 44:32.096
Keep your chin up.

709
44:34.633 --> 44:36.641
There you go. That looks better.

710
44:43.767 --> 44:48.057
The unit will be quiet now that those two old-timers are gone.

711
44:48.057 --> 44:51.497
- I'm actually a bit uneasy. - Me too.

712
44:51.497 --> 44:55.443
Whenever things seem quiet, something always blows up.

713
44:55.443 --> 44:57.103
You scared me!

714
45:00.511 --> 45:03.257
Corporal Sung Yoon Mo. I have business in Barracks 1.

715
45:03.257 --> 45:04.704
What is it?

716
45:04.704 --> 45:08.577
Another exposé was posted on the unit forum.

717
45:08.577 --> 45:10.408
Really?

718
45:10.408 --> 45:13.087
Corporal Sung Yoon Mo. I have business in Barracks 1.

719
45:13.087 --> 45:14.237
What is it?

720
45:14.237 --> 45:18.674
Another exposé was posted on the unit forum.

721
45:18.674 --> 45:20.345
Really?

722
45:20.345 --> 45:22.445
- It was quiet for a while, and now this? - Yes.

723
45:22.445 --> 45:26.256
It says an officer took soldiers to a military supply store during work hours.

724
45:26.256 --> 45:29.617
Live long and prosper, Your Majesty!

725
45:29.617 --> 45:32.037
Please be discharged!

726
45:32.037 --> 45:35.037
- Sergeant Kang Chan Seok? - Yes. It seems so.

727
45:35.037 --> 45:37.857
Who the hell is posting these?

728
45:37.857 --> 45:40.446
Well, it was posted while Hyeon Uk was away,

729
45:40.446 --> 45:44.117
so it's 100% certain it wasn't him this time.

730
45:44.117 --> 45:47.277
See? I knew it wasn't Hyeon Uk.

731
45:47.277 --> 45:49.697
Didn't you suspect him?

732
45:49.697 --> 45:53.254
No! That was just a brief misunderstanding.

733
45:54.087 --> 45:55.172
Sorry.

734
45:55.172 --> 45:57.697
Then who is it...

735
45:57.697 --> 46:01.747
It must be someone who knows the 2nd Company very well...

736
46:11.367 --> 46:13.391
- It's not me. - Wait.

737
46:13.391 --> 46:14.950
Freeze!

738
46:14.950 --> 46:16.397
Yes?

739
46:16.397 --> 46:20.370
I know I saw something while I was on night watch.

740
46:21.377 --> 46:24.125
What are you talking about?

741
46:24.868 --> 46:26.667
[Admin Office]

742
46:45.806 --> 46:51.372
I saw you typing away at night. Right, Yoon Mo?

743
46:51.372 --> 46:52.937
That's...

744
46:52.937 --> 46:57.860
I heard you're a slow typist and always get scolded by Corporal No Hee Jeong.

745
46:57.860 --> 47:00.630
But your hands were so fast, Yoon Mo.

746
47:01.997 --> 47:04.366
It's you, isn't it? What's your deal?

747
47:04.366 --> 47:07.911
I thought they'd give me more work if they knew I was fast.

748
47:10.247 --> 47:13.117
- Is that why? - Yes, it is.

749
47:13.117 --> 47:15.867
That slacker.

750
47:16.917 --> 47:18.213
But that guy...

751
47:18.213 --> 47:20.017
Please, please let it slide just once.

752
47:20.017 --> 47:22.117
Just this once... Please keep it a secret.

753
47:22.117 --> 47:25.280
I'll treat you at the PX... Keep it secret...

754
47:25.280 --> 47:26.814
Fine.

755
47:29.377 --> 47:32.212
But wait, besides you...

756
47:32.212 --> 47:35.208
Is there anything suspicious about that No Bat?

757
47:35.988 --> 47:37.937
What kind of suspicious thing?

758
47:37.937 --> 47:42.137
He's always on the computer and knows everything going on in the unit.

759
47:42.137 --> 47:44.057
He's suspicious enough.

760
47:44.057 --> 47:48.961
But lately, after his tennis duties...

761
47:50.829 --> 47:52.915
Corporal No Hee Jeong.

762
47:52.915 --> 47:54.413
I'm sorry...

763
47:54.413 --> 47:58.000
Other than being suspiciously sleepy, dozing off,

764
47:58.000 --> 48:00.797
and being exhausted,

765
48:00.797 --> 48:02.247
there's nothing unusual.

766
48:02.247 --> 48:05.244
Oh? You don't look so good.

767
48:07.690 --> 48:10.516
Really? That's suspicious...

768
48:10.516 --> 48:11.770
He's like a zombie.

769
48:11.770 --> 48:16.480
I don't think he's in any state to care about that stuff.

770
48:16.480 --> 48:18.774
But the strange thing is...

771
48:18.774 --> 48:22.497
His energy comes back when he's scolding me.

772
48:22.497 --> 48:23.858
That's possible.

773
48:23.858 --> 48:25.817
Or maybe...

774
48:25.817 --> 48:28.126
Or maybe what? Just say it...

775
48:28.126 --> 48:29.970
Oh? What the...

776
48:29.970 --> 48:31.637
- When did you get here? - You scared me...

777
48:31.637 --> 48:34.750
I just got here! You all seemed to be having an interesting conversation.

778
48:34.750 --> 48:36.375
How did you come in so quietly?

779
48:36.375 --> 48:39.470
I love deducing things like this.

780
48:39.470 --> 48:42.597
Really? Then what do you think, Bit Na Ri?

781
48:42.597 --> 48:45.457
There is one person I suspect.

782
48:45.457 --> 48:47.617
It's the assistant platoon leader.

783
48:47.617 --> 48:50.305
- The assistant platoon leader? - Sergeant First Class Im Seong Min?

784
48:50.305 --> 48:53.561
Of course, there's another force controlling him.

785
48:53.561 --> 48:55.535
That force is...

786
48:56.937 --> 48:58.272
Former battalion commander.

787
48:58.272 --> 49:00.017
He said my mother was in critical condition...

788
49:00.017 --> 49:02.417
The former battalion commander, who left in disgrace...

789
49:02.417 --> 49:06.947
is using the assistant platoon leader as a mole to cause division and seek revenge.

790
49:06.947 --> 49:09.905
It's all about promotion and long-term service.

791
49:09.905 --> 49:12.105
What do you think? Isn't that plausible?

792
49:12.105 --> 49:14.910
At least make it sound believable.

793
49:14.910 --> 49:17.461
Who would ever agree with that...

794
49:20.046 --> 49:22.082
As expected of a Hanguk University student.

795
49:22.082 --> 49:24.005
- I guess that's possible? - Yes!

796
49:24.005 --> 49:25.545
It really could be!

797
49:25.545 --> 49:28.048
He's close with both soldiers and officers!

798
49:28.048 --> 49:31.834
I'll keep a close eye on him!

799
49:33.275 --> 49:35.465
You scared me!

800
49:35.465 --> 49:37.225
- Sergeant Kim Sang Hun? - Why?

801
49:37.225 --> 49:40.189
Don't know if I should say this, but...

802
49:40.189 --> 49:41.625
Just say it!

803
49:41.625 --> 49:44.484
Could it be Staff Sergeant Choi Il Gu?

804
49:44.484 --> 49:47.485
No way. Why would you bring up Staff Sergeant Choi Il Gu?

805
49:47.485 --> 49:51.185
He said he hated it here, so it's weird that he came back to the unit.

806
49:51.185 --> 49:54.658
And he won't tell us why, no matter how much we ask.

807
49:54.658 --> 49:56.908
That's true...

808
50:01.960 --> 50:06.200
What if... he received a secret offer...

809
50:07.025 --> 50:11.095
and came back to cause chaos for a reward?

810
50:11.765 --> 50:14.754
- An offer from whom? - Well...

811
50:15.545 --> 50:20.458
From now on, cause chaos in the unit.

812
50:20.458 --> 50:22.045
I trust you, comrade.

813
50:22.045 --> 50:26.247
I will be loyal to the Great Leader.

814
50:28.320 --> 50:30.831
I'm rich now!

815
50:33.575 --> 50:37.746
Are you saying he's a spy?

816
50:37.746 --> 50:40.920
At least use your imagination realistically.

817
50:45.125 --> 50:49.578
- This is crazy. - You all think it makes sense?

818
50:49.578 --> 50:51.455
His looks...

819
50:52.175 --> 50:54.491
He does have a strong vibe from that side.

820
50:54.491 --> 51:00.143
Exactly! Otherwise, there's no reason for him to come back to the unit, right?

821
51:00.143 --> 51:05.785
It could be high-level cyber psychological warfare to destroy the unit.

822
51:05.785 --> 51:07.857
Exactly!

823
51:07.857 --> 51:10.425
That's totally possible.

824
51:10.425 --> 51:12.695
This is insane, seriously.

825
51:12.695 --> 51:14.495
Comrades.

826
51:17.865 --> 51:22.165
I'm Special Master Sergeant Choi Il Gu from the North.

827
51:22.165 --> 51:25.249
I shall now carry out a summary execution!

828
51:25.249 --> 51:26.815
Get over here!

829
51:26.815 --> 51:32.294
- I'm sorry! - I'm sorry! Staff Sergeant Choi!

830
51:32.294 --> 51:35.651
- I need to see blood to snap you out of it! - That hurts!

831
51:35.651 --> 51:37.431
- Come here! - Comrade Im Da Hye!

832
51:37.431 --> 51:39.091
Get over here!

833
51:39.091 --> 51:41.625
Sung Yoon Mo, you're talking nonsense again?

834
51:41.625 --> 51:42.878
Get over here! Sung Yoon Mo!

835
51:42.878 --> 51:44.813
- Stay away from me! - You're dead.

836
51:44.813 --> 51:48.393
Park Min Seok, you little brat!

837
51:58.633 --> 52:00.477
[Company Commander, Captain Cho Baek Ho]

838
52:03.623 --> 52:07.460
[Notice: 2012 Captain to Major Promotion Review Results]

839
52:09.567 --> 52:12.721
[95th Infantry Division]

840
52:27.859 --> 52:32.044
[Captain Cho Baek Ho: 2nd Company, 7th Battalion, 45th Regiment, 95th Infantry Division]

841
53:02.665 --> 53:07.595
Company Commander Cho Baek Ho, Major-select! Let's hear it!

842
53:11.405 --> 53:13.725
The company commander is finally becoming a major.

843
53:13.725 --> 53:15.245
This is truly amazing.

844
53:15.245 --> 53:17.825
I'm sure his performance in the Hoguk Exercise helped, right?

845
53:17.825 --> 53:19.530
Of course.

846
53:19.530 --> 53:22.525
I feel like I'm going to cry.

847
53:22.525 --> 53:24.291
No, you're not.

848
53:24.291 --> 53:27.405
He really worked hard for that rank...

849
53:27.405 --> 53:30.043
He's a major-select now.

850
53:30.043 --> 53:33.672
Does 'select' mean he's scheduled?

851
53:33.672 --> 53:34.882
Yes.

852
53:34.882 --> 53:37.705
When will I be a Master Sergeant-select?

853
53:37.705 --> 53:40.205
I want to make Sergeant First Class soon, too.

854
53:40.205 --> 53:43.145
You just got commissioned, you little boot.

855
53:43.145 --> 53:45.481
I was just saying.

856
53:46.368 --> 53:48.374
Here comes the company commander.

857
53:48.374 --> 53:49.853
Company, attention!

858
53:49.853 --> 53:52.265
To Major-select Cho Baek Ho, our Company Commander...

859
53:52.265 --> 53:54.955
Applause, now!

860
53:59.185 --> 54:00.640
Cho Baek Ho!

861
54:00.640 --> 54:03.192
- Cho Baek Ho! - Congratulations, Company Commander!

862
54:03.192 --> 54:06.405
- Cho Baek Ho! Cho Baek Ho! - Okay, that's enough. Hey, stop it.

863
54:06.405 --> 54:08.105
Seriously, you're embarrassing me.

864
54:08.105 --> 54:10.805
And why did you put this up?

865
54:10.805 --> 54:13.165
It's all thanks to you guys. Thank you.

866
54:13.165 --> 54:15.025
- Not at all, sir! - It's nothing, sir!

867
54:15.025 --> 54:17.925
- Who put this up? - Staff Sergeant Choi Il Gu! I did, sir!

868
54:17.925 --> 54:20.744
No, sir! Corporal No Hee Jeong put it up.

869
54:23.765 --> 54:26.575
Move, move!

870
54:28.696 --> 54:30.901
[Cho Baek Ho, Roar!]

871
54:30.901 --> 54:32.905
Wait, First Sergeant? What's this?

872
54:32.905 --> 54:37.185
I told you I'd get you a wreath if you got promoted, sir.

873
54:37.185 --> 54:39.705
When you become a battalion commander, I'll really show you.

874
54:39.705 --> 54:42.845
I appreciate the sentiment.

875
54:42.845 --> 54:45.649
But I don't know if that day will come.

876
54:46.505 --> 54:49.166
Go ahead and read it.

877
54:49.166 --> 54:53.671
"Congrats on Major-select, the White Tiger, Cho Baek Ho..."

878
54:56.894 --> 54:59.185
Read it clearly to the end.

879
54:59.185 --> 55:01.741
First Sergeant, the boys are watching...

880
55:01.741 --> 55:04.089
"Roar!"

881
55:06.645 --> 55:08.265
- Happy now? - Yes.

882
55:08.265 --> 55:11.478
I'm truly grateful.

883
55:11.478 --> 55:16.378
But it's too good to leave here. I should take it home.

884
55:18.545 --> 55:20.234
What's this?

885
55:20.234 --> 55:23.525
"Zucchini Nightclub Grand Opening?"

886
55:24.738 --> 55:27.336
- This is... - Excuse me...

887
55:28.563 --> 55:32.328
"VIP Rooms Available, Piggy Mama?"

888
55:34.039 --> 55:35.885
He said he'd give me a good deal...

889
55:35.885 --> 55:37.796
It's recycled, you punk... Recycled...

890
55:37.796 --> 55:40.896
As long as the front looks nice.

891
55:41.922 --> 55:43.364
- Sorry. - Thank you again,

892
55:43.364 --> 55:45.387
from the bottom of my heart.

893
55:45.387 --> 55:51.365
Got some good news and bad news. Which do you want to hear first?

894
55:51.365 --> 55:53.445
- The good news first! - Good news?

895
55:53.445 --> 55:54.688
- Yes! - Alright!

896
55:54.688 --> 55:59.472
The division commander, in recognition of our company's hard work during training,

897
55:59.472 --> 56:03.213
is treating us to a company dinner next week!

898
56:06.200 --> 56:11.525
- Did Park Min Seok tell his father? - No, sir.

899
56:11.525 --> 56:13.945
- Call him and say thank you. - Yes, sir!

900
56:13.945 --> 56:15.026
Thank you!

901
56:15.026 --> 56:18.165
Wait, Company Commander! Then what's the bad news?

902
56:18.165 --> 56:19.943
The bad news?

903
56:19.943 --> 56:21.567
Well...

904
56:22.725 --> 56:24.910
How should I put this...

905
56:39.685 --> 56:42.225
It already feels empty without those two.

906
56:42.225 --> 56:43.665
You're right.

907
56:43.665 --> 56:49.565
Usually, the 3rd squad room would be so loud with them bickering right now...

908
56:49.565 --> 56:53.917
I miss Sergeant Kang Chan Seok and Sergeant Choi Byeong Nam already.

909
56:53.917 --> 56:55.865
I know what you mean.

910
56:59.587 --> 57:01.213
Huh? What's all this?

911
57:01.213 --> 57:05.425
Hey, Byeong Nam and Chan Seok ordered this for you guys to eat.

912
57:05.425 --> 57:09.551
I ran like crazy to sneak this in from the guardhouse. Seriously.

913
57:11.184 --> 57:12.205
Awesome!

914
57:12.205 --> 57:15.405
Hey, enjoy it and save some for me. I have to go back quickly.

915
57:15.405 --> 57:17.556
- Yes, sir! - Yes, sir!

916
57:17.556 --> 57:19.320
Sergeant Kang Chan Seok, Sergeant Choi Byeong Nam...

917
57:19.320 --> 57:21.525
- Hey, set it up! - Thank you!

918
57:21.525 --> 57:24.453
- Looks delicious! - It really does!

919
57:24.453 --> 57:28.139
- Enjoy your meal! - Enjoy your meal!

920
57:33.584 --> 57:35.118
Look at these visuals.

921
57:35.118 --> 57:37.985
They just piled fries and cheese on top of the chicken.

922
57:37.985 --> 57:40.965
These aren't just fries. I think they're Aussie Cheese Fries.

923
57:40.965 --> 57:44.606
Aussie Cheese Fries? Does that mean they're "awesome?"

924
57:45.293 --> 57:49.865
No, Aussie Cheese Fries originated in Australia, and it's when you put...

925
57:49.865 --> 57:51.065
I know, I know.

926
57:51.065 --> 57:55.280
- Stop explaining and just eat, man. - Yes, sir!

927
57:56.070 --> 57:58.205
Chicken, fries, and cheese!

928
57:58.205 --> 58:01.772
There's no way this combination can taste bad. No way!

929
58:01.772 --> 58:06.405
This spicy scent is so familiar...

930
58:06.405 --> 58:09.845
Doesn't it smell like those really spicy and delicious noodles?

931
58:09.845 --> 58:13.352
Look at these dumplings! They're so full of juice!

932
58:14.828 --> 58:17.765
The seasoning is perfect! And...

933
58:17.765 --> 58:20.805
It has that spicy noodle flavor and a smoky aroma.

934
58:20.805 --> 58:23.128
It's a total stress reliever. Seriously!

935
58:23.128 --> 58:24.731
Stress?

936
58:24.731 --> 58:27.505
I've been under a lot of stress lately.

937
58:27.505 --> 58:29.285
- What relieves it? - Company Commander!

938
58:29.285 --> 58:31.076
What can you eat to relieve it?

939
58:31.076 --> 58:32.775
Company Commander!

940
58:34.223 --> 58:36.729
This has a great smoky ramyeon flavor.

941
58:36.729 --> 58:39.269
It's so deliciously spicy that I can't stop eating it!

942
58:39.269 --> 58:42.225
You really have to eat this on a regular basis!

943
58:42.225 --> 58:46.181
I'll send chicken to the unit after I'm discharged too.

944
58:46.181 --> 58:48.986
- I'll send chicken after I'm discharged too! - Really?

945
58:48.986 --> 58:51.782
Then I'll treat you guys to 10 chickens when I'm discharged.

946
58:51.782 --> 58:54.785
- But Company Commander, you can't leave. - That's right.

947
58:54.785 --> 58:57.638
- Why not? - You have to stay here forever.

948
58:57.638 --> 59:02.725
I'm off duty! Time to dig in.

949
59:02.725 --> 59:04.685
- Good job! - Is it already time for your shift change?

950
59:04.685 --> 59:07.436
Yes, sir. It is.
